/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The past year has been filled with exciting leaps forward for the Purdue I-O family! We have much to share in this edition of the annual PAGSIP Newsletter with information for Purdue Day of Giving \(pg. 6\), upcoming SIOP presentations \(pg. 15\), and so much more. You can also find more information on the Purdue I-O Psychology program website and our social media platforms. )
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [23 24]
>>
