148 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Hi everyone! I'm a first-year Ph.D. student in the Tay lab. I'm also a Computer Science faculty member at Rose-Hulman Institute of Technology. I studied Computer Science and Cognitive Science at Pomona College for undergrad, and worked as a product manager at Google and as a research manager in the Tay lab before my full pivot to academia. My research interests include well-being, relationships, machine learning, and big data. Outside of work/school, I love running and all things performing arts \(violin, piano, singing, and dancing!\). Looking forward to meeting you all! Email: lioug@purdue.edu.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
